    "title": "What channel is Duke vs UConn basketball today? Time, TV schedule to watch Elite 8 game",
    "text": "Updated March 29, 2026, 9:43 p.m. ETThe final game of the so-called \"championship region\" may have saved the best for last.Jon Scheyer and No. 1 overall seed Duke will take on Dan Hurley and No. 2 seed Connecticut, winners of two of the last three national champions, to conclude the Elite Eight and finalize the Final Four bracket. The heavyweight bout between the Blue Devils and Huskies will see the winner advance to the national semifinals against No. 3 Illinois, winner of the South Region.The Elite Eight matchup has been circled since Selection Sunday, with Duke getting rewarded for its season with arguably the toughest Elite Eight game of any No. 1 seed. The Blue Devils didn't look like world-beaters in the first two rounds against Siena and TCU, but reached this stage with the return of Caleb Foster, who helped spur an 80-75 Sweet 16 victory over No. 5 seed St. John's with 11 points.Scheyer and Co. will take on a UConn team coming off a similarly tough victory against No. 3 seed Michigan State in the Sweet 16, following victories over No. 15 seed Furman and No. 7 seed UCLA.Watch select March Madness games with Fubo (free trial)Here's how to watch Duke and UConn's Elite Eight game, including tipoff time, TV schedule and streaming information, odds and more:What channel is Duke vs UConn basketball on today in Elite Eight?TV: CBSStreaming: NCAA March Madness Live | Fubo (free trial)Duke vs. UConn will air nationally on CBS, with Ian Eagle, Robbie Hummel, Stan Van Gundy and Tracy Wolfson on the call. Streaming options for the game include NCAA March Madness Live, with a valid cable login, and Fubo, the latter of which offers a free trial to potential subscribers. Stream Duke-UConn live with Fubo (free trial)Duke-UConn Elite Eight start time todayDate: Sunday, March 29Time: 5:05 p.m. ETLocation: Capital One Arena (Washington, D.C.)Tipoff for Duke-UConn is scheduled for March 29 at 5:05 p.m. ET from Capital One Arena in Washington, D.C.Duke vs UConn picks, predictions, oddsOdds courtesy of BetMGM as of Saturday, March 28Odds: Duke (-5.5)Over/under: 133.5Moneyline: Duke (-225) | UConn (+185)USA TODAY Sports picked Duke vs UConn here.Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.Gambling involves risk. Please only gamble with funds that you can comfortably afford to lose. While we do our utmost to offer good advice and information we cannot be held responsible for any loss that may be incurred as a result of gambling. We do our best to make sure all the information that we provide on this site is correct. However, from time to time mistakes will be made and we will not be held liable. Please check any stats or information if you are unsure how accurate they are. No guarantees are made with regards to results or financial gain. All forms of betting carry financial risk and it is up to the individual to make bets with or without the assistance of information provided on this site and we cannot be held responsible for any loss that may be incurred as a result of following the betting tips provided on this site. Past performances do not guarantee success in the future and betting odds fluctuate from one minute to the next. The material contained on this site is intended to inform, entertain and educate the reader and in no way represents an inducement to gamble legally or illegally or any sort of professional advice.Gannett may earn revenue from sports betting operators for audience referrals to betting services. Sports betting operators have no influence over nor are any such revenues in any way dependent on or linked to the newsrooms or news coverage. Terms apply, see operator site for Terms and Conditions. If you or someone you know has a gambling problem, help is available. Call the National Council on Problem Gambling 24/7 at 1-800-GAMBLER (NJ, OH), 